      "leadSummary": "**Core insight.** Finite strings, rational numbers, infinite binary sequences and real intervals do not all have the same cardinality.\n**Running case.** A data scientist asserts that all infinite datasets can be indexed by an ordinary list of integers. Test the claim on rational values and infinite bit streams.\n**Restr",
